# Backend Implementation Plan: Step-by-Step Approach

Since the AI detection model is still being trained, we will build the backend by dividing it into clear, independent phases (divisions). We'll start with the easiest, most foundational parts and gradually add complexity. We'll set up a mock or placeholder for the AI service so the main application can function without waiting for the actual model.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Please review the proposed divisions below. Do you agree with starting with the Node.js/Express foundation and PostgreSQL database setup (Phase 1) and leaving the actual AI integration (Phase 5) for later? 
> Also, for local development, are you comfortable using standard JWTs for authentication before moving to AWS Cognito?

