## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- We will set up basic API tests using a tool like Postman or automated testing frameworks like `Jest` and `Supertest` to verify endpoints return the correct status codes (e.g., 200 OK, 401 Unauthorized).

### Manual Verification
- We will run the Express server locally.
- We will use Postman/Insomnia or the browser to hit the `/api/health` endpoint.
- We will test user registration and login flows to ensure JWTs are issued correctly.
